WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.476
Before the rain, every minute matters.

2
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.092
A blocked drain is part of a bigger network.

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:15.016
RainReady brings those connections into view, so teams can decide where to act first.

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:22.928
Two crews. Two hours. Five feasible tasks in this simulated township.

5
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.444
When capacity changes, the plan changes with it.

6
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.240
Your team stays in control.

7
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:37.960
Review the evidence. Check the schedule. Approve the work.

8
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:43.124
RainReady. A clearer plan before the rain.

